# Demo fixtures are OOXML zip containers. Mark them binary so that no
# filter, diff driver, or line-ending normalisation can ever touch them on
# checkout or commit. A CRLF/LF translation applied to a zip container
# silently corrupts it -- the file still has a plausible size, and the
# corruption only surfaces when something tries to open it.
#
# `binary` is the built-in macro for `-text -diff`, i.e. never do
# end-of-line conversion and never attempt a textual diff.
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
